text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'All Sliver creatures get +1/+1.', 'All Sliver creatures have "{2}: This creature gets +0/+1 until end of turn."', 'All Sliver creatures have "{2}: This creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn."', 'All Sliver creatures have flying.', 'All Sliver creatures have trample.', 'All Slivers have "Pay 2 life: Return this permanent to its owner\'s hand."', 'All Slivers have "{2}, Sacrifice this permanent: Draw a card."', 'All Slivers have "{2}, Sacrifice this permanent: This permanent deals 2 damage to any target."', 'All Slivers have "{2}, Sacrifice this permanent: You gain 4 life."', 'All Slivers have "{2}: Regenerate this permanent."', "All Slivers have shroud. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities.)", 'All creatures lose all abilities and have base power and toughness 1/1.', 'All damage that would be dealt this turn to target creature you control by a source of your choice is dealt to another target creature instead.', 'Any player may cast creature spells with mana value 3 or less without paying their mana costs and as though they had flash.', "As Volrath's Laboratory enters the battlefield, choose a color and a creature type.\n{5}, {T}: Create a 2/2 creature token of the chosen color and type.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a land.\nSearch your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player chooses target player who controls more creatures than they do and is their opponent. The first player may reveal cards from the top of their library until they reveal a creature card. If the first player does, that player puts that card onto the battlefield and all other cards revealed this way into their graveyard.", 'At the beginning of each upkeep, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', 'At the beginning of your end step, you may reveal your hand and put all land cards from it onto the battlefield. If you do, discard your hand.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, Jinxed Idol deals 2 damage to you.\nSacrifice a creature: Target opponent gains control of Jinxed Idol.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if there are no Reflection tokens on the battlefield, create a 2/2 white Reflection creature token.\n{0}: Destroy target Reflection.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, tap Carnophage unless you pay 1 life.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a treasure counter on Legacy's Allure.\nSacrifice Legacy's Allure: Gain control of target creature with power less than or equal to the number of treasure counters on Legacy's Allure. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)", 'Buyback {2} (You may pay an additional {2} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nReturn the top creature card of your graveyard to the battlefield. That creature gains haste until end of turn. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.', "Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nEvincar's Justice deals 2 damage to each creature and each player.", 'Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nFanning the Flames deals X damage to any target.', 'Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nPrevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn.', "Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nReturn target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nTarget creature gets +3/+0 until end of turn.', "Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nTarget land becomes a 2/2 creature that's still a land. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)", 'Buyback {4} (You may pay an additional {4} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nCreate a 1/1 black Rat creature token.', 'Buyback {4} (You may pay an additional {4} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nSearing Touch deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Buyback {4} (You may pay an additional {4} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nTarget creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Buyback {5} (You may pay an additional {5} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nDraw a card.', 'Buyback—Discard two cards. (You may discard two cards in addition to any other costs as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nCounter target spell.', 'Buyback—Sacrifice a land. (You may sacrifice a land in addition to any other costs as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nCreate a 1/1 white Pegasus creature token with flying.', 'Caldera Lake enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}. Caldera Lake deals 1 damage to you.', 'Cast this spell only during your end step.\nAs an additional cost to cast this spell, pay X life.\nDraw X cards.', 'Choose two target creatures controlled by the same player. Exile one of those creatures and put two +1/+1 counters on the other.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', "Counter target spell with mana value X. (For example, if that spell's mana cost is {3}{U}{U}, X is 5.)", 'Counter target spell.', 'Counter target spell.\nDraw a card.', "Craven Giant can't block.", 'Creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', "Crovax the Cursed enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may sacrifice a creature. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on Crovax. If you don't, remove a +1/+1 counter from Crovax.\n{B}: Crovax gains flying until end of turn.", 'Defender\nWhen Wall of Blossoms enters the battlefield, draw a card.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nWall of Diffusion can block creatures with shadow as though Wall of Diffusion had shadow.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nWhenever Wall of Essence is dealt combat damage, you gain that much life.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nWhenever Wall of Souls is dealt combat damage, it deals that much damage to target opponent or planeswalker.", 'Destroy all creatures target player controls. For each creature that died this way, that player creates two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', "Destroy all creatures that aren't enchanted. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy all enchantments.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact, creature, or land. Aftershock deals 3 damage to you.', 'Destroy target artifact.', 'Destroy target blocked creature.', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target tapped creature.', 'Discard a card: Regenerate Patchwork Gnomes. (The next time this creature would be destroyed, instead tap it, remove it from combat, and heal all damage on it.)', 'Discard a card: Thalakos Drifters gains shadow until end of turn. (It can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', 'Discard a creature card: Vampire Hounds gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Distribute two +1/+1 counters among one or two target creatures.', 'Draw four cards. You skip your next turn.', 'Draw three cards, then discard a card.', "Dream Prowler can't be blocked as long as it's attacking alone.", 'Each creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature on the battlefield that shares at least one creature type with it. (For example, if two Goblin Warriors and a Goblin Shaman are on the battlefield, each gets +2/+2.)', 'Each player chooses from among the permanents they control an artifact, a creature, an enchantment, and a land, then sacrifices the rest.', 'Each player exiles all creature cards from their graveyard, then sacrifices all creatures they control, then puts all cards they exiled this way onto the battlefield.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated. That creature's controller may sacrifice a permanent for that player to ignore this effect until end of turn.\n{1}{U}: Return Volrath's Curse to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.\n{W}: Return Shackles to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+3.\n{W}: Return Conviction to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and can't block.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.\nWhen enchanted creature becomes the target of a spell or ability, destroy that creature. It can't be regenerated.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -1/-1 and has fear. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Enchant creature\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage to an opponent, you may draw a card.', 'Enchant creature\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Exchange control of target artifact or creature and another target permanent that shares one of those types with it. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\nWhen Commander Greven il-Vec enters the battlefield, sacrifice a creature.", 'First strike', 'First strike\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if your opponents control no creatures, Kezzerdrix deals 4 damage to you.', 'First strike\nWhenever Renegade Warlord attacks, each other attacking creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\n{R}: Sandstone Warrior gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "First strike, forestwalk, vigilance (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike, it can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest, and attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", "First strike, protection from black and from red (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike. It can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything black or red.)", "Flame Wave deals 4 damage to target player or planeswalker and each creature that player or that planeswalker's controller controls.", 'Flying', "Flying\nAs Dracoplasm enters the battlefield, sacrifice any number of creatures. Dracoplasm's power becomes the total power of those creatures and its toughness becomes their total toughness.\n{R}: Dracoplasm gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", "Flying\nDiscard a card: Return Ephemeron to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\nDiscard a creature card: Skyshroud Vampire gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Flying\nExalted Dragon can't attack unless you sacrifice a land. (This cost is paid as attackers are declared.)", "Flying\nPay 2 life: Return Selenia, Dark Angel to its owner's hand.", "Flying\nRevenant's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.", 'Flying\nThopter Squadron enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it.\n{1}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Thopter Squadron: Create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying. Activate only as a sorcery.\n{1}, Sacrifice another Thopter: Put a +1/+1 counter on Thopter Squadron. Activate only as a sorcery.', "Flying\nWhen Avenging Angel dies, you may put it on top of its owner's library.", 'Flying\nWhenever Angelic Protector becomes the target of a spell or ability, Angelic Protector gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{0}: The next 1 damage that would be dealt to Spirit en-Kor this turn is dealt to target creature you control instead.', 'Flying\n{1}{B}: Regenerate Screeching Harpy.', 'Flying\n{B}: Dungeon Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{R}: Flowstone Wyvern gets +2/-2 until end of turn.', "Flying\n{T}, Tap two untapped creatures you control: Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\n{T}: Mawcor deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Flying\n{T}: Target creature gains flying until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{U}: Change the target of target spell or ability that targets only Silver Wyvern. The new target must be a creature.', "Flying\n{U}: Put Wayward Soul on top of its owner's library.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nSacrifice Shard Phoenix: It deals 2 damage to each creature without flying.\n{R}{R}{R}: Return Shard Phoenix from your graveyard to your hand. Activate only during your upkeep.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhen Rathi Dragon enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you sacrifice two Mountains.", 'Flying, first strike', "Hammerhead Shark can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.", 'Heartwood Dryad can block creatures with shadow as though Heartwood Dryad had shadow.', "If Mox Diamond would enter the battlefield, you may discard a land card instead. If you do, put Mox Diamond onto the battlefield. If you don't, put it into its owner's graveyard.\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.", 'Kindle deals X damage to any target, where X is 2 plus the number of cards named Kindle in all graveyards.', 'Krakilin enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\n{1}{G}: Regenerate Krakilin.', 'Lightning Blast deals 4 damage to any target.', "Magmasaur enters the battlefield with five +1/+1 counters on it.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may remove a +1/+1 counter from Magmasaur. If you don't, sacrifice Magmasaur and it deals damage equal to the number of +1/+1 counters on it to each creature without flying and each player.", 'Mindless Automaton enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\n{1}, Discard a card: Put a +1/+1 counter on Mindless Automaton.\nRemove two +1/+1 counters from Mindless Automaton: Draw a card.', "Mogg Conscripts can't attack unless you've cast a creature spell this turn.", "Mogg Flunkies can't attack or block alone.", "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", 'Needle Storm deals 4 damage to each creature with flying.', 'Pine Barrens enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}. Pine Barrens deals 1 damage to you.', 'Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.\nDraw a card.', 'Protection from black\nShadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', 'Protection from red\nShadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', 'Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. You lose life equal to its mana value.', "Put target creature on top of its owner's library.", 'Rather than pay the mana cost for a spell, its controller may discard a card that shares a color with that spell.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\n{W}: Mounted Archers can block an additional creature this turn.', 'Return two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all land cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.', 'Rolling Thunder deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', 'Sacrifice Bottle Gnomes: You gain 3 life.', 'Sacrifice Mogg Fanatic: It deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Sacrifice Skyshaper: Creatures you control gain flying until end of turn.', "Sacrifice a creature, Return Recurring Nightmare to its owner's hand: Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. Activate only as a sorcery.", 'Sacrifice a creature: Goblin Bombardment deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Salt Flats enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}. Salt Flats deals 1 damage to you.', 'Scabland enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}. Scabland deals 1 damage to you.', "Sea Monster can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.", 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for three cards and reveal them. Target opponent chooses one. Put that card into your hand and the rest into your graveyard. Then shuffle.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', "Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nDauthi Horror can't be blocked by white creatures.", 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nDauthi Slayer attacks each combat if able.', "Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nDauthi Warlord's power is equal to the number of creatures with shadow on the battlefield.", "Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nDiscard a card: Return Thalakos Scout to its owner's hand.", "Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nSoltari Lancer has first strike as long as it's attacking.", 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nWhen Thalakos Seer leaves the battlefield, draw a card.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nWhenever Soltari Champion attacks, other creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nWhenever Soltari Trooper attacks, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\n{0}: The next time Soltari Guerrillas would deal combat damage to an opponent this turn, it deals that damage to target creature instead.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\n{B}{B}, Sacrifice Dauthi Jackal: Destroy target blocking creature.', 'Shadowstorm deals 2 damage to each creature with shadow.', 'Skip your draw step.\nWhenever you play a card, draw a card.\nYour maximum hand size is two.', 'Skyshroud Forest enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}. Skyshroud Forest deals 1 damage to you.', 'Spike Breeder enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Breeder: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Breeder: Create a 1/1 green Spike creature token.', 'Spike Colony enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Colony: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Spike Feeder enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Feeder: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\nRemove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Feeder: You gain 2 life.', 'Spike Hatcher enters the battlefield with six +1/+1 counters on it.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Hatcher: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\n{1}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Hatcher: Regenerate Spike Hatcher.', 'Spitting Hydra enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it.\n{1}{R}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spitting Hydra: It deals 1 damage to target creature.', 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Telethopter gains flying until end of turn.', 'Tap target creature. It deals damage equal to its power to another target creature.', 'Target blocking creatu